{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35181","headline":"经故宅有感 · 周繇","name":"经故宅有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身没南荒雨露赊，朱门空锁旧繁华。\n池塘凿就方通水，桃杏栽成未见花。\n异代图书藏几箧，倾城罗绮散谁家。\n昔年埏埴生灵地，今日生人爲叹嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}